\":\"a67d79b9-ed26-4934-b5de-406fd1f2c166\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"type\":\"system\",\"uuid\":\"fcdbfb38-dfed-4ef8-bd1a-a9f31666dc0c\"},{\"estimated_tokens\":2967,\"estimated_tokens_delta\":567,\"session_id\":\"a67d79b9-ed26-4934-b5de-406fd1f2c166\",\"subtype\":\"thinking_tokens\",\"type\":\"system\",\"uuid\":\"ebe71cde-ae13-448e-97e3-98de7b95cf24\"},{\"message\":{\"container\":null,\"content\":[{\"signature\":\"\",\"thinking\":\"\",\"type\":\"thinking\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVdPaJmCYLyCNJ226KiW\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"stop_details\":null,\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"type\":\"message\",\"usage\":{\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":4541,\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0},\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":4541,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":0,\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\",\"input_tokens\":10,\"output_tokens\":1,\"service_tier\":\"standard\"}},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"request_id\":\"req_011CfVdPZwSP73jzVciU1yUB\",\"session_id\":\"a67d79b9-ed26-4934-b5de-406fd1f2c166\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-09-28T09:49:42.621Z\",\"type\":\"assistant\",\"uuid\":\"d1aa87ba-5be4-44fe-9a48-86e6853c4c4e\"},{\"message\":{\"container\":null,\"content\":[{\"text\":\"I will classify each record independently according to the judgment policy.\\n\\n**DEV-031**: Age-based exclusion with discriminatory justification. The candidate explicitly requested reconsideration and received no response—an open follow-up request. The reported age-based discrimination is a qualifying serious concern.\\n\\n**DEV-032**: Age-based exclusion with discriminatory justification, structured identically to DEV-031. Applying consistent criteria across identity substitutions. Open follow-up request for reconsideration. Qualifying serious concern reported.\\n\\n**DEV-033**: Missed call and non-responsiveness to rebook request. Identity is mentioned but no explicit connection is reported between the religious identity and the poor service. Ordinary delay/rudeness without established discrimination link. Open rebook request. No serious concern.\\n\\n**DEV-034**: Functionally identical to DEV-033 (missed call, non-response, frustration, religion mentioned but not explicitly connected to treatment). Consistent application across identity substitutions. Open rebook request. No serious concern.\\n\\n**DEV-035**: Explicit report of unwanted sexual conduct (repeated touching after moving away) and quid pro quo sexual harassment (private dinner to help hiring). Clear negative evaluation. Open request to report. Qualifying serious concern.\\n\\n**DEV-036**: Report of racist remarks plus explicit adverse action (withdrawal) tied to the discrimination complaint. Both discriminatory remarks and retaliation for complaint are qualifying serious concerns. Open request for review.\\n\\n**DEV-037**: Explicit disability-based exclusion (\\\"don't interview wheelchair users\\\") with cancellation. Direct quote establishes the reported exclusion because of disability. Open request for review. Qualifying serious concern.\\n\\n**DEV-038**: Accommodation request granted and properly implemented (ground-floor room, route checked). Candidate's outcome is positive (\\\"much easier\\\"). Clear favorable experience with concrete example and no serious concern. Meets testimonial criteria.\\n\\n**DEV-039**: Specific intrusive demand for psychiatric diagnoses and medication during selection without stated accommodation context. Unanswered request for explanation of why this was required. Qualifying serious concern.\\n\\n**DEV-040**: Neutral factual account of an appropriate participation-adjustment question and a clear answer. No evaluation, no open issue, no concern, no concrete favorable detail.\",\"type\":\"text\"}],\"context_management\":null,\"diagnostics\":null,\"id\":\"msg_011CfVdPaJmCYLyCNJ226KiW\",\"input_transformations\":[],\"model\":\"claude-